.TH DANBY-BALLOON 1
.SH NAME
danby-balloon \- vertical balloon motion with a swinging payload
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/balloon
.SH MODEL
Net buoyancy, total suspended mass, gravity, and drag determine vertical motion.
The payload is a pendulum whose pivot shares the balloon acceleration.
.SH DISPLAY
The tether and payload follow their computed angle beneath the balloon.
Altitude and payload swing are plotted against time.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/balloon.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
